## Configuration

<ParamField path="settings" type="AcmeLocalSTTService.Settings" default="None">
  Runtime-configurable settings. Not a type-mismatch: the one entry matches
  `STTUpdateSettingsFrame`'s `settings` too, but the page's subject is the
  service.
</ParamField>

These can be updated mid-conversation with `STTUpdateSettingsFrame`.
